# The model weights are not committed (see .gitignore), so no Git LFS is needed.
# If you ever decide to commit them instead, add the two filter lines below and
# run `git lfs install` first — each ResNet-50 checkpoint is ~92 MiB, past
# GitHub's 50 MB warning and close to its 100 MiB hard limit.
#   *.pth    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
#   *.joblib filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

* text=auto
*.csv text
*.json text
*.md text
*.py text
*.yaml text
*.ipynb text
